WEBVTT

00:01:59.991 --> 00:02:02.243
Writing my story gave me comfort.

00:02:03.911 --> 00:02:07.165
But it also taught me a lot
about how to write.

00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:11.335
I never shared that spiral
notebook with anyone.

00:02:14.213 --> 00:02:16.132
But what I didn’t realize then

00:02:16.132 --> 00:02:19.844
was I was writing something
called fanfiction --

00:02:19.844 --> 00:02:23.014
(Laughter)

00:02:23.639 --> 00:02:28.978
a story based on characters
or settings from another’s work ...

00:02:28.978 --> 00:02:30.688
and that I was not alone.